# --- Project runtime artifacts ---
# SQLite import manifests written by the tool (normally inside the
# destination folder, but never commit one if it lands in the repo).
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
# Copies of a device's Photos database, if a debugging session ever drops one here.
# They hold the metadata of every photo on the phone and must never be committed.
Photos.sqlite*
dcim.json
.ipm/
*.ipm-part

# Logs
*.log
logs/

# --- macOS ---
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# --- Editors / IDEs ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- Claude Code working files (local only, never published) ---
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
**/CLAUDE.md
.claude/
.claude*/

# --- Hardware test configuration (machine-specific, never published) ---
# Holds the UDID of the phone the hardware suite is allowed to talk to, the
# destination it may use, and the list of items it may delete. See
# MANUAL_TESTING.md. The .example file next to it IS versioned.
.ipm-hw.env
tests/hardware/sacrificial.txt
.check-logs/
